{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A scientist needs your help to pack for a conference trip, but be sure not to pack any hot items next to any meltable items, nor any liquid containers next to any electronics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A family needs your help to pack their rucksacks for a camping trip, but the childrens' plushies are very picky about who and what they're packed near!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rock musician needs your :-- well, you get the idea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outpacked is a logic puzzle game about efficiently packing items into grid-based inventories while satisfying their various constraints. Think &quot;Tetris meets Sudoku&quot;.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4012320?t=1761900777","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4012320?t=1761900777","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012320/0f3ec92029d50e223406a34c5099ff9ff82ef857/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761900777","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012320/0f3ec92029d50e223406a34c5099ff9ff82ef857/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761900777","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4068820,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A scientist needs your help to pack for a conference trip, but be sure not to pack any hot items next to any meltable items, nor any liquid containers next to any electronics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A family needs your help to pack their rucksacks for a c